	<https://www.reqvire.org/ontology#validationIssueKindName> "semantic-reference-found-outside-context" ;
	<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A semantic-contract SHACL reference points to an IRI declared by an ontology element that is outside the contract's explicit ontology-use context." .
