	<https://www.reqvire.org/ontology#validationIssueKindName> "semantic-conflicting-declaration" ;
	<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The same ontology term IRI is declared with incompatible semantic roles across ontology elements." .
