	<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://www.reqvire.org/ontology#ChangeImpactPath> ;
	<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://www.reqvire.org/ontology#ChangeImpactEdge> ;
	<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Propagation edge included in a change-impact path." .
