	<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://www.reqvire.org/ontology#EvidenceBackedVerification> ;
	<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Test verification" ;
	<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Verification through test procedures, automated tests, fixtures, or observed test evidence." .
