	<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Canonical verification rollup rule token used by coverage analysis and semantic validation." .
<https://www.reqvire.org/ontology#rollupCondition> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> ;
	<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://www.reqvire.org/ontology#VerificationRollupRule> ;
